    {
      "id": "tang-395",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "无题",
      "subtitle": "来是空言去绝踪",
      "author": "李商隐",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "来是空言去绝踪，月斜楼上五更钟。\n梦为远别啼难唤，书被催成墨未浓。\n蜡照半笼金翡翠，麝熏微度绣芙蓉。\n刘郎已恨蓬山远，更隔蓬山一万重！",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "bfc3591aad7d5e48847a07068db4dd6dd0b4d7d2ac1eb4794142e59fce8eaf79",
      "estimatedOutput": 734,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/tang-395--bfc3591aad7d5e48847a07068db4dd6dd0b4d7d2ac1eb4794142e59fce8eaf79.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "tang-396",
      "category": "唐诗",
      "title": "西施",
      "subtitle": "",
      "author": "罗隐",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "content": "家国兴亡自有时，吴人何苦怨西施。\n西施若解倾吴国，越国亡来又是谁。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "55ce7fa0d731655dd633ee45daf67843d277e939ff7d162acc4aca9128c27826",
